  "title": "What happens when you ask ChatGPT to apply to 500 jobs for you? I tried this and landed 12",
  "description": "What happens when you ask ChatGPT to apply to 500 jobs for you? I tried this and landed 12 interviews in 24 hours. Prompt 1: Upload your resume and say: \"Act as a senior recruiter. Based on my resume, list the 20 job titles I'm most qualified for and the exact keywords ATS systems scan for in each.\" Prompt 2: \"Rewrite my resume into a master template I can tailor instantly. Use the Google XYZ formula and strip every red flag a hiring manager spots in under 10 seconds.\" Prompt 3: Turn on Agent Mode and say: \"Go to LinkedIn and Indeed, find every job matching these titles posted in the last 7 days, and build me a spreadsheet with the link, match score, and a custom tailored resume for each one.\" Prompt 4: \"Apply to the top 500 highest matched jobs. Customize each application based on the job description.\" ChatGPT literally applies to jobs for you while you sleep. #chatgpt #ai #jobsearch #resume #career",
